# ============== Landing-page-specific ignores ==============
#
# Personal payment assets (NEVER commit these to the public repo)
# -----------------------------------------------------------
# The placeholders (zelle.png, paynow.png, etc.) ARE tracked so
# the site works out of the box. To use your real QRs:
#   1. Save them anywhere with `.local.` in the filename
#      e.g. .zelle.png.local.PNG, zelle.png.local, .paynow.JPG.local
#      The presence of `.local.` ANYWHERE in the filename blocks it.
#   2. Run ./scripts/copy_personal_assets.sh to copy them over
#      the placeholders before deploying
#
# HOW THIS WORKS
# --------------
# The ignore pattern `*\.local.*` matches any file that has the
# substring `.local.` in its name. This catches BOTH the case
# where `.local` is at the end (.zelle.png.local) AND when it's
# in the middle (.zelle.png.local.PNG).
#
# Test results:
#   zelle.png          → tracked  (placeholder, matches allow rule)
#   zelle.png.local    → ignored  (matches *.local.* block)
#   .zelle.png.local   → ignored  (matches *.local.* block)
#   .zelle.png.local.PNG → ignored (matches *.local.* block)
#   zelle.local.png    → ignored  (matches *.local.* block)
#   zelle.PNG.local    → ignored  (matches *.local.* block)

# Block any file containing `.local.` in its name
*\.local.*
*.LOCAL.*
*\.local
*.LOCAL

# Demo video (if you record one locally before uploading to YouTube)
*\.local.mp4
*\.local.MP4
*\.local.webm
*\.local.WEBM
*\.local.mov
*\.local.MOV

# Any local secrets (in case you ever inline Formspree / API keys)
.env
.env.local
.secrets.local

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ============================================================
# ALLOW RULES (placed AFTER the block rules)
# ============================================================
# The placeholder PNGs/JPGs (zelle.png, paynow.png, wechat.png,
# alipay.png) MUST be tracked so the site works out of the box.
# These allow rules explicitly re-include them. Because the block
# rules above are MORE SPECIFIC (they match `*\.local.*` which the
# allow rules don't), this works correctly.
!/zelle.png
!/zelle.jpg
!/zelle.jpeg
!/zelle.webp
!/paynow.png
!/paynow.jpg
!/paynow.jpeg
!/paynow.webp
!/wechat.png
!/wechat.jpg
!/wechat.jpeg
!/wechat.webp
!/alipay.png
!/alipay.jpg
!/alipay.jpeg
!/alipay.webp
!/README.md
